   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Prezados,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Estou tentando centralizar a legenda do eixo X em uma figura com vários gráficos.</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Estou conseguindo centralizar a legenda da linha inferior como no exemplo, mas as linhas do meio não.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">par(mfrow=c(2,2))</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">plot(rnorm(100),xlab=&quot;&quot;,ylab=&quot;y1&quot;)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">plot(rnorm(100),xlab=&quot;&quot;,ylab=&quot;y2&quot;)</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">mtext(side=1,cex=2,line=-1.8,text=&quot;Variável Explanatória 1&quot;,outer=TRUE)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">### o problema está aqui, pois a legenda desce para a parte inferior da figura.</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">plot(rnorm(100),xlab=&quot;&quot;,ylab=&quot;y1&quot;)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">plot(rnorm(100),xlab=&quot;&quot;,ylab=&quot;y2&quot;)</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">mtext(side=1,cex=2,line=-1.8,text=&quot;Variável Explanatória 2&quot;,outer=TRUE)## Esse dá certo</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Alguém podia dar uma luz de como eu posso fazer isso?</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Abraços</font></div></div></div><div><br></div>-- <br><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"></blockquote><div>\r\n\r\n<b style=\"font-size:12.727272033691406px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Luciano F. Sgarbi</b><br><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Mestrando em Ecologia e Evolução</span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Laboratório de Ecologia de Insetos (sl. 222)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Departamento de Ecologia<br>Instituto de Ciências Biológicas - ICB 1<br>Universidade Federal de Goiás, campus II<br>\r\n\r\nGoiânia-GO<br>74001-970</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Brazil</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
